0:43.600" end="00:44.140">thunder</span><span begin="00:44.140" end="00:44.140">!</span><span begin="00:44.140" end="00:44.140">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.140" end="00:47.710"><span begin="00:44.140" end="00:44.140">（</span><span begin="00:44.140" end="00:44.680">Rah</span><span begin="00:44.680" end="00:44.740">-</span><span begin="00:44.740" end="00:44.980">rah</span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.010">-</span><span begin="00:45.010" end="00:45.370">rah</span><span begin="00:45.370" end="00:45.400">-</span><span begin="00:45.400" end="00:46.300">rah</span><span begin="00:46.300" end="00:46.330">-</span><span begin="00:46.330" end="00:47.080">rah</span><span begin="00:47.080" end="00:47.110">, </span><span begin="00:47.110" end="00:47.710">thunder</span><span begin="00:47.710" end="00:47.710">!</span><span begin="00:47.710" end="00:47.710">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.710" end="00:53.140"><span begin="00:47.710" end="00:47.710">（</span><span begin="00:47.710" end="00:48.310">Rah</span><span begin="00:48.310" end="00:48.340">-</span><span begin="00:48.340" end="00:48.550">rah</span><span begin="00:48.550" end="00:48.580">-</span><span begin="00:48.580" end="00:48.970">rah</span><span begin="00:48.970" end="00:49.000">-</span><span begin="00:49.000" end="00:49.900">rah</span><span begin="00:49.900" end="00:49.930">-</span><span begin="00:49.930" end="00:50.710">rah</span><span begin="00:50.710" end="00:50.720">!</span><span begin="00:50.720" end="00:50.740">） </span><span begin="00:50.740" end="00:52.030">Thunder</span><span begin="00:52.030" end="00:53.140">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.140" end="00:57.880"><span begin="00:53.140" end="00:54.250">（</span><span begin="00:54.250" end="00:55.600">Thunder</span><span begin="00:55.600" end="00:56.740">!</span><span begin="00:56.740" end="00:57.880">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.880" end="01:00.460"><span begin="00:57.880" end="00:59.440">Thunder</span><span begin="00:59.440" end="01:00.460">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.460" end="01:04.420"><span begin="01:00.460" end="01:01.480">（</span><span begin="01:01.480" end="01:02.800">Thunder</span><span begin="01:02.800" end="01:03.610">!</span><span begin="01:03.610" end="01:04.420">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.420" end="01:06.220"><span begin="01:04.420" end="01:04.660">I </span><span begin="01:04.660" end="01:04.900">was </span><span begin="01:04.900" end="01:05.830">caught</span><span begin="01:05.830" end="01:06.220">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.220" end="01:11.680"><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:06.550">In </span><span begin="01:06.550" end="01:06.640">the </span><span begin="01:06.640" end="01:07.240">middle </span><span begin="01:07.240" end="01:07.450">of </span><span begin="01:07.450" end="01:07.630">a </span><span begin="01:07.630" end="01:08.500">railroad </span><span begin="01:08.500" end="01:09.790">track</span><span begin="01:09.790" end="01:10.090">! </span><span begin="01:10.090" end="01:10.390">（</span><span begin="01:10.390" end="01:11.590">Thunder</span><span begin="01:11.590" end="01:11.630">!</span><span begin="01:11.630" end="01:11.680">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.680" end="01:13.480"><span begin="01:11.680" end="01:11.890">I </span><span begin="01:11.890" end="01:12.190">looked </span><span begin="01:12.190" end="01:13.090">'round</span><span begin="01:13.090" end="01:13.480">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.480" end="01:18.790"><span begin="01:13.480" end="01:13.750">And </span><span begin="01:13.750" end="01:13.900">I </span><span begin="01:13.900" end="01:14.410">knew </span><span begin="01:14.410" end="01:14.650">there </span><span begin="01:14.650" end="01:14.860">was </span><span begin="01:14.860" end="01:15.160">no </span><span begin="01:15.160" end="01:15.910">turnin' </span><span begin="01:15.910" end="01:16.810">back</span><span begin="01:16.810" end="01:17.230">! </span><span begin="01:17.230" end="01:17.650">（</span><span begin="01:17.650" end="01:18.760">Thunder</span><span begin="01:18.760" end="01:18.770">!</span><span begin="01:18.770" end="01:18.790">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.790" end="01:20.770"><span begin="01:18.790" end="01:19.150">My </span><span begin="01:19.150" end="01:19.600">mind </span><span begin="01:19.600" end="01:20.560">raced</span><span begin="01:20.560" end="01:20.770">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.770" end="01:26.050"><span begin="01:20.770" end="01:20.950">And </span><span begin="01:20.950" end="01:21.070">I </span><span begin="01:21.070" end="01:21.610">thought</span><span begin="01:21.610" end="01:21.610">, </span><span begin="01:21.610" end="01:22.000">"</span><span begin="01:22.000" end="01:22.420">What </span><span begin="01:22.420" end="01:22.780">could </span><span begin="01:22.780" end="01:22.930">I </span><span begin="01:22.930" end="01:24.160">do</span><span begin="01:24.160" end="01:24.160">?</span><span begin="01:24.160" end="01:24.190">" </span><span begin="01:24.190" end="01:24.880">（</span><span begin="01:24.880" end="01:26.020">Thunder</span><span begin="01:26.020" end="01:26.030">!</span><span begin="01:26.030" end="01:26.050">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.050" end="01:27.730"><span begin="01:26.050" end="01:26.410">And </span><span begin="01:26.410" end="01:26.470">I </span><span begin="01:26.470" end="01:27.700">knew</span><span begin="01:27.700" end="01:27.730">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.730" end="01:32.920"><span begin="01:27.730" end="01:28.090">There </span><span begin="01:28.090" end="01:28.270">was </span><span begin="01:28.270" end="01:28.690">no </span><span begin="01:28.690" end="01:29.110">help</span><span begin="01:29.110" end="01:29.350">, </span><span begin="01:29.350" end="01:29.740">no </span><span begin="01:29.740" end="01:29.950">help </span><span begin="01:29.950" end="01:30.340">from </span><span begin="01:30.340" end="