</span><span begin="01:51.000" end="01:51.250">. </span><span begin="01:51.250" end="01:52.960">thunderstruck</span><span begin="01:52.960" end="01:58.060">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.060" end="02:00.220"><span begin="01:58.060" end="01:58.540">Rode </span><span begin="01:58.540" end="01:58.900">down </span><span begin="01:58.900" end="01:59.110">the </span><span begin="01:59.110" end="02:00.190">highway</span><span begin="02:00.190" end="02:00.220">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.220" end="02:05.230"><span begin="02:00.220" end="02:00.670">Broke </span><span begin="02:00.670" end="02:00.850">the </span><span begin="02:00.850" end="02:01.660">limit</span><span begin="02:01.660" end="02:01.720">, </span><span begin="02:01.720" end="02:02.140">we </span><span begin="02:02.140" end="02:02.470">hit </span><span begin="02:02.470" end="02:02.710">the </span><span begin="02:02.710" end="02:04.180">town</span><span begin="02:04.180" end="02:05.230">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.230" end="02:07.570"><span begin="02:05.230" end="02:05.770">Went </span><span begin="02:05.770" end="02:06.130">through </span><span begin="02:06.130" end="02:06.280">to </span><span begin="02:06.280" end="02:07.540">Texas</span><span begin="02:07.540" end="02:07.570">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.570" end="02:12.430"><span begin="02:07.570" end="02:08.050">Yeah</span><span begin="02:08.050" end="02:08.050">, </span><span begin="02:08.050" end="02:08.890">Texas</span><span begin="02:08.890" end="02:08.890">, </span><span begin="02:08.890" end="02:09.070">and </span><span begin="02:09.070" end="02:09.430">we </span><span begin="02:09.430" end="02:09.730">had </span><span begin="02:09.730" end="02:10.090">some </span><span begin="02:10.090" end="02:11.470">fun</span><span begin="02:11.470" end="02:12.430">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.430" end="02:14.980"><span begin="02:12.430" end="02:12.910">We </span><span begin="02:12.910" end="02:1